{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_title", "source_sha256": "188e8b35488d44643776346953dd2a9c4a22d8cc780ffad6da6d66015718a0ea", "ja": "心広がる Sunshine Rhythm!", "zh": "开阔心灵 Sunshine Rhythm!", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9c14a7ea0785cb851fd2884f194100ede4168d0d5778ef95b0f2fb081ee90b3a", "ja": "天体をモチーフにした定期公演、\n『Sunshine Rhythm!』のライブを\n間近に控えた、アイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "以天体为概念的定期公演──\n『Sunshine Rhythm!』的演唱会就快开始了，\n这是偶像们在此期间的一幕场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "44caccccbb2999f2cca71e7cb864dae421c3e71484a8ad017a61c5793775bfe8", "ja": "―定期天体公演『Sunshine Rhythm!』最終日―", "zh": "──定期天体公演『Sunshine Rhythm!』最后一天──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "5e9ae7c0a053da3edf261bb006837626f2d9cd4be3e57738290ef3300a9e3d99", "ja": "……くつは、だいじょうぶ、っと。\nのり子さん、わたしの衣装、へんなところないよね？", "zh": "……鞋子没问题。\n法子姊姊，我的服装应该没有奇怪的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "8eb6779a87e2697d175442f308938b05f154a297f253cb61c4660402f5ddc48a", "ja": "えっと～……うん。おっけー！\n問題ないよ、育。", "zh": "我看看……嗯，OK！\n没问题喔，育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "b5ad340767926e059cf10ec28afee6c5fbe68ed70301fd0f07b9825f2d62ac54", "ja": "ありがとう、のり子さん！　おかえしに\nわたしがのり子さんの衣装、見てあげるね！", "zh": "谢谢你，法子姊姊！为了感谢你，\n我也来帮法子姊姊看一下服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "28d217f2f6ba7052e20c24f74646965c3c7d23680b8a541f94eec0ca75f8606e", "ja": "さすがイク！　ベリーグッドです！\nあとはカオリの衣装ですけど、どうですか？", "zh": "不愧是育！Very Good！\n现在只剩歌织的服装了，怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "7eb1a6ec33088517cfe3916e801e3a53c699f290660194d7c03fed8ccf7beb1c", "ja": "お待たせ、ロコちゃん。私も終わったから、\n衣装はもう大丈夫ね。莉緒ちゃん、みんなのメイクは？", "zh": "让你久等了，ROCO。我也换完了，\n所以服装都没问题了。莉绪，大家的妆都好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "9ace117162d9c7613ccd40a88d52ea06646ac7b0147f77eb499b0e5144477845", "ja": "ハイライトだけ、ちょっと強くして、っと……よし。\nはい、もういいわよ、エミリーちゃん。", "zh": "打亮再多一点……好。\n好了，已经化好啰，艾蜜莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "a9cd2ef736e5c15c39fdb7afecd154026a00b33257280ecfc9b8176fd2502c92", "ja": "ありがとうございます、莉緒さん！\nこれでみなさまのお化粧は……。", "zh": "谢谢你，莉绪姊姊！\n这样一来大家的妆都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "00e0db4b86843c1dd89ac2cd53150131c7aedff8b9346634f29bd637750eb494", "ja": "エミリーで最後、だから……\nこれで、全員……スタンバイ、OK……♪", "zh": "艾蜜莉是最后一个，所以……\n这样全员都……准备OK了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "55ba2f24c3f06ddc8b907860c0d36310ce662ad46ed8251171ed6a3c199c28a3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせです！\nもう入ってもいいですよー！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让你久等了！\n已经可以进来了喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1010_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0fdf9aedbfce22f905595e880f68e49fdd5f14a13b5fd193b2a37e304acf1250", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\n準備はバッチリみたいだな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n看来你们都做好万全准备了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "3b3fa36ce396255dca4da71e6841faa03dba123c717304eed541a14c235508fc", "ja": "ええ、ちょっと手間どっちゃったけど。\nその代わり、みんなかわいくなったでしょ？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "是啊，虽然花了点功夫。\n不过，大家也因此变得更可爱了对吧？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "f857b5d2f947d3ce08f9146ffd05e1eb85ef03ec0b7d290338fa59c7f800538a", "ja": "あの……仕掛け人さま？\n私たちの支度姿、いかがですか？", "zh": "请问……策划执行人先生，\n我们打扮后的模样看起来如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_1014", "source_sha256": "f161f8a1da3d9709b6a119b5218bb43561ca7d1adeaef280a41a78108900ce59", "ja": "かわいい", "zh": "很可爱", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2000_p", "source_sha256": "efb21b6216bd7fa7fe0e126e0029b37a9fe749dae66e7971972ec830c30fa73c", "ja": "うん、かわいいぞ。\nおそろいの衣装もメイクも、全員よく似合ってるよ！", "zh": "嗯，很可爱喔。\n不管是同款的服装还是妆容，都很适合大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2001_032emi", "source_sha256": "0447c9006d0a7415e91ce0d771efb6454202f5d6fbe9e87eb5d16a6791b2ec05", "ja": "えへへ……ありがとうございます！\nそのように褒めていただけると、うれしいです♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢！\n很高兴能得到策划执行人先生的赞赏♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2002_046rio", "source_sha256": "01368793089145c03b7fe7d4c79c936076966948d30b3cff63b990f85e2b2375", "ja": "{$P$}くんも気に入ってくれたし、\nファンのみんなにも喜んでもらえそうね♪", "zh": "既然{$P$}觉得好看，\n我想粉丝应该也会喜欢的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2003_037nao", "source_sha256": "7fde98cc3cd935c2c774bc599b2dc1a0df7fdd9cdf110bdbca30fab6b410d4a2", "ja": "今日は『Sunshine Rhythm!』メンバー勢揃いの\n公演やからな。みんなで一緒に盛り上げていっくで～！", "zh": "今天是『Sunshine Rhythm!』成员齐聚一堂的公演嘛。\n大家一起来炒热气氛吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2004_025roc", "source_sha256": "d0e10bb5d0d4c4121c69d2609827d7804740bca998325306a1f3591a3c2019c9", "ja": "はい、ロコたちのコスチュームをオールナイトで\nプロダクションしてくれた、ミサキのためにも！", "zh": "没错，这也是为了All night都在替ROCO我们进行\nCostume Production的美咲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2005_030iku", "source_sha256": "ba6cf2554a027d14801d0e231d7cae7ff08296999bbeb3b319c7c009caf99d8f", "ja": "えっと……おーるないとで、ぷろ……。", "zh": "呃……All night都在，Pro……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2006_025roc", "source_sha256": "80718f99d9ee113374ab6b12d82701e7990e4b0f6afe7df0537b6f41ea6466ec", "ja": "はっ。ええと、つまりですね……。\nミサキのハートを胸に、パフォーマンスしましょう！", "zh": "啊，呃，总而言之就是……\n把美咲的Heart记在心上，一起进行Performance吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2007_030iku", "source_sha256": "1c04663b2a6ddb7f54a8f10bfea9e410528d5b8f981d4385df9f1dbde65d128b", "ja": "あ、うん、もちろん！　わたしも、みんなと\n気持ちをひとつにして、がんばるね！", "zh": "啊，嗯，那是当然的！\n我也会跟大家同心协力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2008_043nor", "source_sha256": "abd5ffb4def5c8d3577ec821bbeb652f09caabb794b899c74d4e998b076b51fe", "ja": "{$P$}。次の美奈子たちの\n曲が終ったら、いよいよ私たちの番だよね？", "zh": "{$P$}，等下一首美奈子她们的\n歌曲结束，就终于要轮到我们了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2009_p", "source_sha256": "743c68969e42900a2ce0907f69d6ae901f278d0af97cfdf56c61a702cd45eecb", "ja": "ああ、みんながステージに出れば、\n『Sunshine Rhythm!』勢揃いだな。", "zh": "是啊，等大家站上舞台，\n『Sunshine Rhythm!』就齐聚一堂了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2010_032emi", "source_sha256": "7be0943c1899206f947e0ed8c44d2f36d500cb757a1d2f24f6cd533f3ba0d5d0", "ja": "はい。日光律動の顔ぶれ全員での、太陽律動管弦楽団。\nごヒイキ様方に、早くお披露目したいです♪", "zh": "嗯，由『阳光律动』全体成员表演的\n『阳光律动管弦乐』，真想快点展现给主顾们看看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2011_037nao", "source_sha256": "23484f2561ea83ca16b45f65714f0749bfc023160ef336a55f6ad933768d236f", "ja": "それに、私らの後も『BlueMoon Harmony!』、\nそれから『Starlight Melody!』に続くんやし。", "zh": "而且『BlueMoon Harmony!』也会接在我们后面，\n在那之后还有『Starlight Melody!』呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2012_024ann", "source_sha256": "40912e33f2622b19b9f04c2e26ceec305fabc0436ca9bc967f22c836d4c9da55", "ja": "天体公演の、バトン……。\nしっかり、渡せるように……。", "zh": "天体公演的接力棒……\n一定要好好传下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2013_052kao", "source_sha256": "603d1ffc4c5ddf90cb55bbe5cd82ad5985eea71039b9dcde52f567e5900bc405", "ja": "みんなで夢をつないで、どこまでも行けるように……。\nまずはこのステージ、頑張りましょうね！", "zh": "为了和大家一起延续梦想，拓展无限的可能性……\n就先努力让这次的表演圆满成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2014_043nor", "source_sha256": "5f40cc81059cad5cd60b3d57a34b34b9f65eb55d18753b1daa824bfb26df678f", "ja": "う～、燃えてきた！　ねえ{$P$}、\nガツンと気合い入れてよ！", "zh": "唔～我燃起斗志了！欸，{$P$}，\n好好帮我们提振一下士气吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2015_p", "source_sha256": "317380cbd7f740088dcfede9894558d70fdaf05c11e29c9d8eed25861c8dfaad", "ja": "気合いか……。それじゃ、可奈達が考えてくれた、\nあの掛け声でどうだ？", "zh": "士气啊……那就用之前可奈她们想的\n那个口号怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_013_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_01_2016_025roc", "source_sha256": "f77b92d2496208106c628e00278ce72655f98bbddf4b4d5aacede98508c34006", "ja": "グッドアイデアです！　それでは……\nカオリ、イントロダクションをお願いできますか？", "zh": "Good idea！那就……\n歌织，Introduction可以麻烦你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
